OL,3,GNEWSAMan City's Omar Marmoush fined
OL,4,Aover uninsured McLaren
OL,5,
OL,6,FTottenham striker Omar Marmoush has
OL,7,Fbeen fined after his McLaren supercar
OL,8,Fwas found to be uninsured and not
OL,9,Fdeclared off the road.
OL,11,FThe 27-year-old, who joined Spurs on
OL,12,Floan from Manchester City in August,
OL,13,Fwas found guilty at Teesside
OL,14,FMagistrates' Court on 5 October.
OL,16,FHe was fined #220 and ordered to pay
OL,17,F#100 in costs and an #88 victim
OL,18,Fsurcharge, according to the Press
OL,19,FAssociation (PA).
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
