OL,3,GNEWSAMan City's Omar Marmoush fined
OL,4,Aover uninsured McLaren
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Driver and Vehicle Licensing Agency
OL,7,F(DVLA) brought the prosecution after
OL,8,FMarmoush failed to pay a fixed penalty
OL,9,Fissued in June.
